    "title": "Mid-Level Instructional Designer at SSC Tube South Asia Partners",
    "description": "Grow your career with SSC Tube South Asia Partners! We are hiring a Instructional Designer for our Rajkot team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout SSC Tube South Asia Partners:\nSSC Tube South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n• Conduct doubt-clearing sessions and remedial classes for weak students\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n• Maintain classroom discipline and create a positive learning environment\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n• Proficiency in Educational Technology\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Child Psychology\n• Proficiency in MS Office\n• Proficiency in Research Skills\n• Proficiency in Pedagogy\n• Proficiency in Content Creation\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Rajkot, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SSC Tube South Asia Partners!",
